a Body has
    x
    vx
to makeBody startX
    nb is a Body with x startX, vx 1
    return nb

bodies are empty
count from 1 to 1000 as i
    makeBody i make b
    add b to bodies
.
start timer clock
count from 1 to 60 as frame
    for each body in bodies
        nx is x of body plus vx of body
        if nx is greater than 2000
            vx of body is 0 minus 1
        .
        x of body is nx
    .
.
say "60 frames x 1000 bodies ms:" elapsed milliseconds of clock
